      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767931563247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "专注于当前layer,\n所有底层全部只关注API,\n专注于功能本身",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "专注于当前layer,\n所有底层全部只关注API,\n专注于功能本身",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EKO6NT5FOfzij2xO-yZmC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3167.1460118959567,
      "y": -426.64447178946466,
      "width": 332.25994873046875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1597147475,
      "version": 440,
      "versionNonce": 930900117,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767931563247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "不断地迭代,\n基于已构建的东西,\n这样已经构建好的相当于 存档,\n以只需要在 存档 上继续搭建逻辑，\n比如说cmake有 存档 所以迭代很快，\n专注于构建本身\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不断地迭代,\n基于已构建的东西,\n这样已经构建好的相当于 存档,\n以只需要在 存档 上继续搭建逻辑，\n比如说cmake有 存档 所以迭代很快，\n专注于构建本身\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
