      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 500411507,
      "version": 259,
      "versionNonce": 813620341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767931563248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "比如说嵌入式，\n如果你想把程序写得很小，\n你就没有办法用高级语言",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "比如说嵌入式，\n如果你想把程序写得很小，\n你就没有办法用高级语言",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7t4IomMLPITnL1ayONoVO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5320.77265746153,
      "y": -982.0210607912115,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1647027731,
      "version": 290,
      "versionNonce": 1840612821,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767931563248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "除非有一天内存的成本很低了",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "除非有一天内存的成本很低了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zboPVvgct3jbvw0CN9tsK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4879.707512919844,
      "y": -890.735589511399,
      "width": 364.4199816582154,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2022927283,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 353370933,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767931563248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cmsis和hal库文档的图示，简化了思考，\n因为抽象程度变高了，\n如果不能把一个事情分成清晰的步骤，\n那这个事情就会看起来很混乱，\n即使说他本来没有那么难",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cmsis和hal库文档的图示，简化了思考，\n因为抽象程度变高了，\n如果不能把一个事情分成清晰的步骤，\n那这个事情就会看起来很混乱，\n即使说他本来没有那么难",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "We466HYpplr0Y0qq-OtlP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3167.146011183402,
      "y": -852.8836732489096,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
